{"seq":2,"slug":"replication","title":"复制与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/replication","wordCount":899,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"复制与分发\">复制与分发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQLite 的单文件架构原生不支持复制，但随着它在生产环境的使用增多，社区与商业项目发展出了多种方案把数据库同步到多节点：<strong>Litestream</strong> 将 WAL 流式复制到对象存储，<strong>LiteFS</strong> 通过 FUSE 文件系统透明复制到只读副本，<strong>Turso/libsql</strong> 则把 SQLite 扩展为分布式形态。它们在复制模式、延迟与复杂度上各有取舍。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"突破单文件限制\">突破单文件限制</h2><p>SQLite 的单文件架构意味着原生不支持数据库复制。但随着 SQLite 在生产环境中的使用日益增多，社区和商业项目发展出了多种复制方案，让 SQLite 数据库可以在多个节点间同步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 复制方案&#10;        LS[Litestream&lt;br/&gt;WAL 流式复制]&#10;        LFS[LiteFS&lt;br/&gt;FUSE 文件系统]&#10;        TURSO[Turso / libsql&lt;br/&gt;分布式 SQLite]&#10;    end&#10;    LS --&gt;|流到 S3/GCS| OBJECT[(对象存储)]&#10;    LFS --&gt;|透明复制| REPLICAS[只读副本]&#10;    TURSO --&gt;|全球分发| EDGE[边缘节点]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 复制方案\n        LS[Litestream&lt;br/&gt;WAL 流式复制]\n        LFS[LiteFS&lt;br/&gt;FUSE 文件系统]\n        TURSO[Turso / libsql&lt;br/&gt;分布式 SQLite]\n    end\n    LS --&gt;|流到 S3/GCS| OBJECT[(对象存储)]\n    LFS --&gt;|透明复制| REPLICAS[只读副本]\n    TURSO --&gt;|全球分发| EDGE[边缘节点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>复制模式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>写入节点</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Litestream</td>\n<td>WAL → S3</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>单主</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LiteFS</td>\n<td>FUSE 文件系统</td>\n<td>亚秒</td>\n<td>单主</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turso</td>\n<td>libsql 协议</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>多区域</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"litestream\">Litestream</h2><p><strong>Litestream</strong> 是一个独立运行的守护进程，持续监控 SQLite 的 WAL 文件变化，并将增量数据流式复制到远程存储（S3、GCS、Azure Blob 等）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    APP[应用] --&gt; DB[(SQLite)]&#10;    DB --&gt; WAL[-wal 文件]&#10;    LS[Litestream] --&gt;|监控| WAL&#10;    LS --&gt;|流式传输| S3[(S3 / GCS)]&#10;    S3 --&gt;|恢复| DB2[(副本)]\">graph LR\n    APP[应用] --&gt; DB[(SQLite)]\n    DB --&gt; WAL[-wal 文件]\n    LS[Litestream] --&gt;|监控| WAL\n    LS --&gt;|流式传输| S3[(S3 / GCS)]\n    S3 --&gt;|恢复| DB2[(副本)]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Litestream 要求 WAL 模式&#10;PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;&#10;&#10;-- Litestream 会管理 checkpoint，应禁用自动 checkpoint&#10;PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint = 0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Litestream 要求 WAL 模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA journal_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Litestream 会管理 checkpoint，应禁用自动 checkpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Litestream 的核心特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>透明复制</td>\n<td>应用无需任何修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量传输</td>\n<td>只传输 WAL 变化部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间点恢复</td>\n<td>支持恢复到任意历史时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标</td>\n<td>同时复制到多个存储后端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td>自动压缩存档的 WAL 段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { execSync } from &#39;node:child_process&#39;;&#10;&#10;function restoreFromLitestream(bucket: string, dbPath: string) {&#10;  execSync(`litestream restore -o ${dbPath} s3://${bucket}/myapp.db`, { stdio: &#39;inherit&#39; });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { execSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:child_process'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> restoreFromLitestream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`litestream restore -o ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dbPath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} s3://${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bucket</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/myapp.db`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { stdio: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inherit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Litestream 通过接管 WAL checkpoint 来确保所有变更都被捕获。在使用 Litestream 时，应将 <code>wal_autocheckpoint</code> 设为 0，让 Litestream 全权管理 checkpoint 时机。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"litefs\">LiteFS</h2><p><strong>LiteFS</strong> 是 Fly.io 开发的基于 <strong>FUSE</strong>（Filesystem in Userspace）的分布式文件系统。它在文件系统层面拦截 SQLite 的读写操作，实现透明的主从复制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 主节点&#10;        APP1[应用] --&gt; FUSE1[LiteFS FUSE]&#10;        FUSE1 --&gt; DB1[(SQLite)]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 从节点 1&#10;        APP2[应用&lt;br/&gt;只读] --&gt; FUSE2[LiteFS FUSE]&#10;        FUSE2 --&gt; DB2[(SQLite 副本)]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 从节点 2&#10;        APP3[应用&lt;br/&gt;只读] --&gt; FUSE3[LiteFS FUSE]&#10;        FUSE3 --&gt; DB3[(SQLite 副本)]&#10;    end&#10;    FUSE1 --&gt;|事务流| FUSE2&#10;    FUSE1 --&gt;|事务流| FUSE3\">graph TD\n    subgraph 主节点\n        APP1[应用] --&gt; FUSE1[LiteFS FUSE]\n        FUSE1 --&gt; DB1[(SQLite)]\n    end\n    subgraph 从节点 1\n        APP2[应用&lt;br/&gt;只读] --&gt; FUSE2[LiteFS FUSE]\n        FUSE2 --&gt; DB2[(SQLite 副本)]\n    end\n    subgraph 从节点 2\n        APP3[应用&lt;br/&gt;只读] --&gt; FUSE3[LiteFS FUSE]\n        FUSE3 --&gt; DB3[(SQLite 副本)]\n    end\n    FUSE1 --&gt;|事务流| FUSE2\n    FUSE1 --&gt;|事务流| FUSE3</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Litestream</th>\n<th>LiteFS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复制层面</td>\n<td>WAL 文件级</td>\n<td>FUSE 文件系统级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读副本</td>\n<td>需要手动恢复</td>\n<td>实时可读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入限制</td>\n<td>单主写入</td>\n<td>单主写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>亚秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署依赖</td>\n<td>S3 兼容存储</td>\n<td>Fly.io / FUSE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障转移</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td>自动（Consul 集成）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LiteFS 的工作原理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- LiteFS 挂载点下的 SQLite 文件&#10;-- 应用像访问本地文件一样操作&#10;&#10;-- 主节点：读写正常&#10;INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 从节点：只读（写操作会被转发到主节点或返回错误）&#10;SELECT * FROM users;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- LiteFS 挂载点下的 SQLite 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 应用像访问本地文件一样操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主节点：读写正常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, email) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从节点：只读（写操作会被转发到主节点或返回错误）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"turso-与-libsql\">Turso 与 libsql</h2><p><strong>Turso</strong> 是基于 <strong>libsql</strong>（SQLite 的开源分支）构建的分布式数据库平台。它将 SQLite 的简洁性与全球分布式架构结合，支持边缘部署和多区域复制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Turso 架构&#10;        PRIMARY[主数据库&lt;br/&gt;某个区域]&#10;        EDGE1[边缘副本&lt;br/&gt;亚太]&#10;        EDGE2[边缘副本&lt;br/&gt;欧洲]&#10;        EDGE3[边缘副本&lt;br/&gt;北美]&#10;        PRIMARY --&gt; EDGE1&#10;        PRIMARY --&gt; EDGE2&#10;        PRIMARY --&gt; EDGE3&#10;    end&#10;    CLIENT1[亚太用户] --&gt; EDGE1&#10;    CLIENT2[欧洲用户] --&gt; EDGE2&#10;    CLIENT3[北美用户] --&gt; EDGE3\">graph TD\n    subgraph Turso 架构\n        PRIMARY[主数据库&lt;br/&gt;某个区域]\n        EDGE1[边缘副本&lt;br/&gt;亚太]\n        EDGE2[边缘副本&lt;br/&gt;欧洲]\n        EDGE3[边缘副本&lt;br/&gt;北美]\n        PRIMARY --&gt; EDGE1\n        PRIMARY --&gt; EDGE2\n        PRIMARY --&gt; EDGE3\n    end\n    CLIENT1[亚太用户] --&gt; EDGE1\n    CLIENT2[欧洲用户] --&gt; EDGE2\n    CLIENT3[北美用户] --&gt; EDGE3</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createClient } from &#39;@libsql/client&#39;;&#10;&#10;const client = createClient({&#10;  url: &#39;libsql://my-database-org.turso.io&#39;,&#10;  authToken: process.env.TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const result = await client.execute(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = ?&#39;, [&#39;北京&#39;]);&#10;&#10;await client.execute({&#10;  sql: &#39;INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)&#39;,&#10;  args: [&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;],&#10;});&#10;&#10;const batch = await client.batch(&#10;  [&#10;    { sql: &#39;INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)&#39;, args: [&#39;Bob&#39;, &#39;bob@example.com&#39;] },&#10;    { sql: &#39;INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)&#39;, args: [&#39;Carol&#39;, &#39;carol@example.com&#39;] },&#10;  ],&#10;  &#39;write&#39;,&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@libsql/client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'libsql://my-database-org.turso.io'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  authToken: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  args: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, args: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bob@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, args: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Carol'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'carol@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>libsql 相比 SQLite 的增强：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>增强功能</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>远程访问</td>\n<td>HTTP/WebSocket 协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式副本</td>\n<td>本地 SQLite + 远程同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多租户</td>\n<td>单实例多数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量搜索</td>\n<td>内置向量相似度函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALTER TABLE 增强</td>\n<td>更完整的 DDL 支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const embeddedClient = createClient({&#10;  url: &#39;file:local-replica.db&#39;,&#10;  syncUrl: &#39;libsql://my-database-org.turso.io&#39;,&#10;  authToken: process.env.TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN,&#10;});&#10;&#10;await embeddedClient.sync();&#10;&#10;const localResult = await embeddedClient.execute(&#39;SELECT * FROM users&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> embeddedClient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file:local-replica.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  syncUrl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'libsql://my-database-org.turso.io'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  authToken: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> embeddedClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> localResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> embeddedClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Turso 的嵌入式副本（Embedded Replica）模式将远程数据库同步到本地 SQLite 文件，读操作完全本地化（零延迟），写操作透明地提交到主数据库并同步回来。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"方案选型\">方案选型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    START[需要 SQLite 复制?]&#10;    START --&gt;|备份到云存储| LS[Litestream]&#10;    START --&gt;|多节点只读副本| LFS[LiteFS]&#10;    START --&gt;|全球分布式| TURSO[Turso]&#10;    START --&gt;|嵌入 + 同步| EMBED[Turso 嵌入副本]\">graph TD\n    START[需要 SQLite 复制?]\n    START --&gt;|备份到云存储| LS[Litestream]\n    START --&gt;|多节点只读副本| LFS[LiteFS]\n    START --&gt;|全球分布式| TURSO[Turso]\n    START --&gt;|嵌入 + 同步| EMBED[Turso 嵌入副本]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策因素</th>\n<th>Litestream</th>\n<th>LiteFS</th>\n<th>Turso</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>备份 + 灾难恢复</td>\n<td>多节点读扩展</td>\n<td>全球分布式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入架构</td>\n<td>单主</td>\n<td>单主</td>\n<td>单主（多区域）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（托管服务）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>存储费用</td>\n<td>Fly.io 费用</td>\n<td>Turso 定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>恢复时秒级</td>\n<td>亚秒级</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((复制与分发))&#10;    Litestream&#10;      WAL 流式复制&#10;      S3 / GCS 存储&#10;      时间点恢复&#10;    LiteFS&#10;      FUSE 文件系统&#10;      实时只读副本&#10;      自动故障转移&#10;    Turso / libsql&#10;      全球分布式&#10;      嵌入式副本&#10;      HTTP / WebSocket&#10;    选型&#10;      备份 → Litestream&#10;      读扩展 → LiteFS&#10;      全球分发 → Turso\">mindmap\n  root((复制与分发))\n    Litestream\n      WAL 流式复制\n      S3 / GCS 存储\n      时间点恢复\n    LiteFS\n      FUSE 文件系统\n      实时只读副本\n      自动故障转移\n    Turso / libsql\n      全球分布式\n      嵌入式副本\n      HTTP / WebSocket\n    选型\n      备份 → Litestream\n      读扩展 → LiteFS\n      全球分发 → Turso</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Litestream</strong> 通过 WAL 流式复制到对象存储，适合备份和灾难恢复。</li>\n<li><strong>LiteFS</strong> 在文件系统层面实现透明复制，适合多节点读扩展。</li>\n<li><strong>Turso/libsql</strong> 提供全球分布式 SQLite，支持边缘部署和嵌入式副本。</li>\n<li>所有方案都遵循<strong>单主写入</strong>模型，写入始终发生在一个节点。</li>\n<li>根据需求选择：备份用 Litestream，读扩展用 LiteFS，全球分发用 Turso。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复制与分发","id":"复制与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"突破单文件限制","id":"突破单文件限制"},{"level":2,"text":"Litestream","id":"litestream"},{"level":2,"text":"LiteFS","id":"litefs"},{"level":2,"text":"Turso 与 libsql","id":"turso-与-libsql"},{"level":2,"text":"方案选型","id":"方案选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"备份与恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/backup-and-restore"},"next":{"title":"嵌入模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/embedded-patterns"}}